// ============================================================================
//  ESP32 4WD Car - BTS7960 x2 - Open-loop distance control
//  + 2x HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensors (front + rear obstacle stop)
//  Protocol: Base,<dir>,<dist>,<speed>   (old format also supported)
//  No encoders required. Pure C++ class/object design.
// ============================================================================



/*
Base,F,<dist>,<speed>    Forward, stop after <dist> metres
Base,B,<dist>,<speed>    Backward, stop after <dist> metres
Base,L,0,<speed>         Pivot left, continuous
Base,R,0,<speed>         Pivot right, continuous
Base,S                   Stop
*/

/*ARM,B	All 8 servos to zero	Instant
ARM,RH	Raise both hands	~1 second
ARM,RS	Right hand shake	~3 seconds
ARM,HB	Hold box sequence	~7 seconds*/


/*HEAD,NCK CAL
   HEAD,CAL*/










